    fix(db): restore idx_cascades_converged_at and de-pin the v3-era assertions
    
    The DF-SPECLANG-016 superset hand-copied 003_cascades.sql into migrations.ts and
    dropped its fourth index; the sibling cascades test pins that index set, so CI went
    red on the merged tree. Added the missing CREATE INDEX to the v3 migration
    (.ts + emitted .js) and replaced the hard-coded version 3 assertions with
    LATEST_VERSION (fresh db now applies v1..v8, and a v2 db re-applies v3..v8).
    Verified: tests/db/cascades-migration.test.ts + tests/db.test.ts +
    tests/db/migrations.test.ts = 45/45.
